{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Raw Types"}], "prev": {"link": "../auto-save-settings/", "title": "AutoSaveSettings"}, "next": {"link": "../available-reaction/", "title": "AvailableReaction"}, "title": "AvailableEffect", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"availableeffect\">\n<h1>AvailableEffect<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#availableeffect\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.raw.types.AvailableEffect\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.raw.types.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">AvailableEffect</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.raw.types.AvailableEffect\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Telegram API type.</p>\n<p>Constructor of <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../base/available-effect/#pyrogram.raw.base.AvailableEffect\" title=\"pyrogram.raw.base.AvailableEffect\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">AvailableEffect</span></code></a>.</p>\n<dl class=\"simple\">\n<dt>Details:</dt><dd><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p>Layer: <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">222</span></code></p></li>\n<li><p>ID: <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">93C3E27E</span></code></p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>id</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></code> <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">64-bit</span></code>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>emoticon</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></code>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>effect_sticker_id</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></code> <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">64-bit</span></code>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>premium_required</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">bool</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>static_icon_id</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></code> <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">64-bit</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>effect_animation_id</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></code> <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">64-bit</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["telegram/types/available-reaction", "AvailableReaction", "N", "next"], ["telegram/types/auto-save-settings", "AutoSaveSettings", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">AvailableEffect</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#pyrogram.raw.types.AvailableEffect\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">AvailableEffect</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": true, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "telegram/types/available-effect", "sidebars": ["sidebar/brand.html", "sidebar/search.html", "sidebar/scroll-start.html", "sidebar/navigation.html", "sidebar/scroll-end.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0], "furo_version": "2025.12.19", "furo_navig